<div>
<p class="xxmsonormal"><strong><img class="alignright wp-image-28665" src="https://facebrasil.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/630C3DC3-51B6-4A99-A2F1-324F297CA280-300x153.jpeg" alt="" width="471" height="240" />16/01 - Big Brother Brasil</strong></p>

