<div class="bbc-189y18v ebmt73l0" dir="ltr">
<div class="bbc-997y1y eihqrxw0" data-e2e="image-placeholder">
<div class="lazyload-wrapper "><img class="e3vrtyk0 bbc-rb7xa0 e1mo64ex0" src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/13BBF/production/_127813808_img_4805.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1008px) 645px, 100vw" srcset="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/13BBF/production/_127813808_img_4805.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/13BBF/production/_127813808_img_4805.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/13BBF/production/_127813808_img_4805.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/13BBF/production/_127813808_img_4805.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/13BBF/production/_127813808_img_4805.jpg 800w" alt="Banheiro de microapartamento na Coreia do Sul" width="1440" height="1080" /></div>
<p class="bbc-1s1cxbv ewbcsnk0" role="text"><span class="bbc-1gnhmg2 ed7bp6y0">Dependendo do apartamento, o banheiro pode ser interno ou compartilhado </span><span lang="en-GB">GAMALELDIN TARAKHAN</span></p>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></figure>
</div>
